You just got to wait and see, man.

00:48:18.462 --> 00:48:19.663
That's all I'mma say about that.

00:48:19.663 --> 00:48:21.398
I don't want to,
you know, create any headlines.

00:48:21.398 --> 00:48:23.133
I think it's already a lot of headlines.

00:48:24.601 --> 00:48:25.869
You know, we just have to wait and see.

00:48:25.869 --> 00:48:29.473
You know, he said he was going to sign at
